{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09288","headline":"过昭国里故第 · 韦应物","name":"过昭国里故第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不复见故人，一来过故宅。\n物变知景暄，心伤觉时寂。\n池荒野筠合，庭绿幽草积。\n风散花意谢，鸟还山光夕。\n宿昔方同赏，讵知今念昔。\n缄室在东厢，遗器不忍觌。\n柔翰全分意，芳巾尚染泽。\n残工委筐箧，余素经刀尺。\n收此还我家，将还复愁惕。\n永绝携手欢，空存旧行迹。\n冥冥独无语，杳杳将何适。\n唯思今古同，时缓伤与戚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}